:NOTE [links:https://fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/1997/2187_2187_2187]
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.
This English text is the consolidation of 1 September 2023. The binding German, French and Italian texts have since been consolidated to 1 June 2026, so this translation is behind current law.

